WEBVTT

00:00:02.140 --> 00:00:03.430
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:06.520
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime</i>

00:00:08.310 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:13.280
<i>GUNDAM</i>

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:13.280
<i>MOBILE SUIT</i>

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:16.280
<i>Minna ga neshizumatta yoru
In the night when everyone else was lost in their sleep...</i>

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:18.620
<i>Mado kara sora wo miru to
I looked at the sky through the window...</i>

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:23.540
<i>Tottemo sugoi mono wo mita n' da
...and there I saw such a great thing!</i>

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:28.840
<i>Otona wa dare mo warai-nagara
All the adults told me with a great big laugh...</i>

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:31.340
<i>Terebi no misugi to iu kedo
"You've been watching way too much television again!"</i>

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:34.920
<i>Boku wa zettai ni zettai ni
But I would never, ever...</i>

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:37.140
<i>Uso nanka itte 'nai
...tell any kind of lie!</i>

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:45.520
<i>Joushiki to iu megane de
This world of ours...</i>

00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:51.020
<i>Boku-tachi no sekai wa
...cannot be viewed through...</i>

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:54.820
<i>Nozokeya shinai no sa
...the glasses of common sense.</i>

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:58.320
<i>Yume wo wasureta
You old earthlings...</i>

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:02.830
<i>furui chikyuu-jin yo
...who have forgotten your dreams!</i>

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:07.830
<i>Anime Ja Nai! Anime Ja Nai!
It's not Anime! It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:10.330
<i>Fushigi na kimochi
Such a wonderful feeling!</i>

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:12.420
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:15.840
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:20.140
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:01:22.010 --> 00:01:25.020
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:01:32.870 --> 00:01:37.000
LEINA VANISHES

00:01:47.190 --> 00:01:50.350
Master Mashymre,
please don't go!

00:01:50.350 --> 00:01:52.350
Dammit, let me go, Glemy!

00:01:52.350 --> 00:01:56.940
How can I remain on the same ship
with that overbearing woman?!

00:01:56.940 --> 00:01:59.730
I don't want to
work for her, either!

00:01:59.730 --> 00:02:01.150
Glemy...

00:02:01.150 --> 00:02:03.460
I'm your subordinate,
Master Mashymre!

00:02:03.460 --> 00:02:07.030
She's a shameless woman
who gets aroused...

00:02:07.030 --> 00:02:09.530
just by sitting
in a mobile suit cockpit

00:02:09.530 --> 00:02:12.830
But I alone should break
military regulations.

00:02:12.830 --> 00:02:14.250
Mashymre Cello.

00:02:14.250 --> 00:02:17.830
I'll take care of the Endra for you.
Go with peace of mind.

00:02:17.830 --> 00:02:20.750
Weren't you just sent
here as a messenger?!

00:02:20.750 --> 00:02:23.050
Gottn! Say something!

00:02:23.050 --> 00:02:25.130
Take care now,
Master Mashymre!

00:02:25.130 --> 00:02:26.470
Let's go, Gottn.

00:02:26.470 --> 00:02:28.310
Yes, Mistress Chara.

00:02:28.310 --> 00:02:30.760
Gottn, you've abandoned me?

00:02:30.760 --> 00:02:32.270
Master Mashymre.

00:02:36.290 --> 00:02:39.490
Master Mashymre!
Please come back!

00:02:44.290 --> 00:02:46.610
Now that Mashymre's gone,

00:02:46.610 --> 00:02:49.240
it's going to hurt that
we can't use the Hamma-Hamma.

00:02:49.240 --> 00:02:51.240
You have the R-Jarja, don't you?

00:02:51.240 --> 00:02:54.130
I don't want to
pilot a mobile suit!

00:02:54.600 --> 00:02:57.830
B-But now that they
have that new Gundam,

00:02:57.830 --> 00:03:01.880
we can't stop the Argama reaching that
dock ship with just our Gaza-Cs.

00:03:02.130 --> 00:03:04.720
That's what's bugging me!

00:03:07.760 --> 00:03:11.550
I know! Why don't we ram
this vessel into the dock ship?

00:03:11.550 --> 00:03:15.810
Not only can we stop the Argama,
but we can resupply the Endra, too!

00:03:15.810 --> 00:03:19.190
Well? Good idea, right?
Yahoo!

00:03:21.910 --> 00:03:25.360
Wow, this is amazing!
It's a mountain of treasure!

00:03:25.360 --> 00:03:27.570
That and this...

00:03:27.570 --> 00:03:29.910
Nothing but pay dirt!

00:03:32.300 --> 00:03:35.370
- Judau!
- We're gonna crash!

00:03:35.800 --> 00:03:37.950
What's the big idea, Judau?!

00:03:37.950 --> 00:03:39.830
I found something amazing!

00:03:39.830 --> 00:03:43.630
A Zaku!
An actual MS-06F!

00:03:43.630 --> 00:03:45.500
It's not even that damaged!

00:03:45.500 --> 00:03:47.340
An MS-06?

00:03:47.340 --> 00:03:50.260
- That's a big-ticket item!
- Let's go!

00:03:50.260 --> 00:03:53.610
- This is no time for training flights!
- Roger!

00:03:53.610 --> 00:03:55.140
Let's go around.

00:03:55.140 --> 00:03:59.320
There might be mines laid
in this floating debris.

00:03:59.320 --> 00:04:01.350
Here, Captain Bright.

00:04:01.350 --> 00:04:02.850
Right. Thank you.

00:04:02.850 --> 00:04:05.460
- And for you, Mr. Torres.
- You work hard.

00:04:05.460 --> 00:04:09.280
This is Judau. I'm changing the schedule
and returning to the Argama!

00:04:09.280 --> 00:04:11.200
This Zaku is still usable.

00:04:11.200 --> 00:04:14.780
Stay on schedule and bring back
supplies from the La Vie en Rose first!

00:04:14.780 --> 00:04:17.710
This is no time
to be trash picking!

00:04:17.710 --> 00:04:19.960
We can turn this
into supplies!

00:04:19.960 --> 00:04:22.500
You'd be surprised at
how much these sell for!

00:04:22.500 --> 00:04:23.880
Listen, you...!

00:04:23.880 --> 00:04:26.460
Big Brother, knock it off!

00:04:26.460 --> 00:04:28.210
Kids should keep quiet!

00:04:28.210 --> 00:04:32.090
You're a kid, too!
Now do as you're told!

00:04:32.090 --> 00:04:33.800
What was that?

00:04:33.800 --> 00:04:36.640
I can't hear you because of
the Minovsky particle density.

00:04:36.640 --> 00:04:38.720
Beecha, how's your end?

00:04:38.720 --> 00:04:40.900
Okay! Let's do it!

00:04:40.900 --> 00:04:42.980
He's pretending
he can't hear us!

00:04:42.980 --> 00:04:45.400
- I'll take responsibility!
- Responsibility?

00:04:45.650 --> 00:04:47.150
You can't do it!

00:04:47.150 --> 00:04:49.570
I have to take on my
brother's responsibility.

00:04:49.570 --> 00:04:50.400
Leina...

00:04:50.400 --> 00:04:53.370
Please! Let me go, Miss Roux!

00:04:53.370 --> 00:04:57.250
Oh, well...
Only if I go with you.

00:04:58.090 --> 00:04:59.540
Thank you, Roux!

00:04:59.540 --> 00:05:01.080
You can't take Leina!

00:05:01.080 --> 00:05:03.080
- It'll be tight.
- Right.

00:05:03.080 --> 00:05:04.750
I'll go instead!

00:05:04.750 --> 00:05:07.540
If I don't go,
my brother will never learn.

00:05:07.540 --> 00:05:09.070
Leina!

00:05:09.070 --> 00:05:12.420
Captain, Roux is requesting
permission to launch.

00:05:12.420 --> 00:05:14.260
- Leina's with her?
- Yes.

00:05:14.260 --> 00:05:17.510
Everyone here just seems
to do whatever they want!

00:05:17.510 --> 00:05:19.010
Let them do it!

00:05:19.010 --> 00:05:23.080
You read that, Roux?
You shouldn't make Dad so angry.

00:05:23.080 --> 00:05:25.140
Roger. I appreciate it.

00:05:25.140 --> 00:05:27.230
Careful you don't
bite your tongue.

00:05:27.230 --> 00:05:28.150
Right.

00:05:28.150 --> 00:05:29.860
- Core Base, Roux!
- And Leina!

00:05:29.860 --> 00:05:31.330
Moving out!

00:05:34.380 --> 00:05:36.450
You have a tough life.

00:05:36.450 --> 00:05:38.750
Not as bad as Captain Bright.

00:05:39.260 --> 00:05:41.130
That's true.

00:05:42.300 --> 00:05:45.510
Why are kids these
days so willful?

00:05:45.510 --> 00:05:47.930
My kids are so obedient.

00:05:48.480 --> 00:05:52.680
Hathaway... Cheimin...
I hope they're okay.

00:05:56.490 --> 00:05:59.440
I'm not a very
good father, am I?

00:06:04.910 --> 00:06:08.900
Enemy dock ship,
now in firing range.

00:06:09.500 --> 00:06:12.940
Okay, we're close enough now.
We've got this!

00:06:12.940 --> 00:06:14.240
Open fire!

00:06:14.240 --> 00:06:16.910
Charge at the dock ship,
full speed ahead!

00:06:20.090 --> 00:06:21.330
Enemy attack!

00:06:21.330 --> 00:06:25.260
I can see it! Return fire at once!
Isn't the Argama here yet?!

00:06:30.980 --> 00:06:33.790
This rhythm... These tremors...

00:06:33.790 --> 00:06:38.390
I feel it! It feels so good!
Take us faster!

00:06:38.390 --> 00:06:41.510
Oh, mess up everything in our way!

00:06:41.510 --> 00:06:45.150
M-Mistress Chara! You're scaring me...

00:06:47.580 --> 00:06:51.270
Yeah! Yeah! Yeah!
Go! Go!

00:06:51.270 --> 00:06:52.820
Mistress Chara...!

00:06:53.210 --> 00:06:55.660
Gaza team, ready for launch!

00:06:58.260 --> 00:06:59.660
STOP THE SHIP!

00:06:59.660 --> 00:07:01.080
Stopping!

00:07:12.230 --> 00:07:14.770
Glemy Toto! You did that?!

00:07:14.770 --> 00:07:16.010
Yes, ma'am!

00:07:16.010 --> 00:07:18.930
Gaza team, launching to
take control of the dock!

00:07:23.990 --> 00:07:26.350
How did the Endra beat us here?!

00:07:26.350 --> 00:07:28.230
We have to warn the Argama!

00:07:28.230 --> 00:07:29.820
Right!

00:07:31.200 --> 00:07:34.820
That light... is it a mobile
suit from the Argama?

00:07:35.500 --> 00:07:37.110
I thought so.

00:07:37.110 --> 00:07:39.910
The one Miss Roux Louka was flying!

00:07:44.050 --> 00:07:45.830
Looks like they've found us.

00:07:45.830 --> 00:07:48.710
Fighter pilot,
identify yourself.

00:07:48.710 --> 00:07:50.600
Is that you, Miss Roux Louka?

00:07:50.600 --> 00:07:52.840
How would the enemy
know who I am?!

00:07:53.560 --> 00:07:56.420
I'm glad. It's me, Glemy.

00:07:56.420 --> 00:07:59.600
Glemy Toto, the one
you stabbed in the back!

00:07:59.600 --> 00:08:01.190
That guy?!

00:08:01.190 --> 00:08:03.400
Well, what?
What do you want?

00:08:03.400 --> 00:08:05.720
I'd like to repay you
for last time.

00:08:05.720 --> 00:08:09.080
My mama always said you have
to make up for your mistakes!

00:08:09.080 --> 00:08:10.230
Your mama?

00:08:10.230 --> 00:08:13.560
Oh, ew! Do you have an
Oedipus complex or something?

00:08:13.560 --> 00:08:16.230
If you make a superficial
analysis of me like that,

00:08:16.230 --> 00:08:18.280
you're gonna be sorry!

00:08:24.470 --> 00:08:27.490
Captain! I'm reading
sudden energy spikes...

00:08:27.490 --> 00:08:30.250
coming from the direction
of the La Vie en Rose.

00:08:30.250 --> 00:08:32.330
Did the Endra beat us there?!

00:08:32.330 --> 00:08:34.040
Mr. Bright, this is amazing!

00:08:34.040 --> 00:08:36.880
You rarely find
anything this good!

00:08:36.880 --> 00:08:39.920
You guys! How can you
just chat away like that?!

00:08:39.920 --> 00:08:41.970
The La Vie en Rose is under attack!

00:08:42.190 --> 00:08:45.100
Then it's just as well we didn't get there.

00:08:45.100 --> 00:08:45.930
- Right?
- Right?

00:08:45.930 --> 00:08:47.430
It's not fine!

00:08:47.430 --> 00:08:50.930
Leina went there in your place
because you all were goofing off!

00:08:50.930 --> 00:08:52.640
What do you mean, Iino?!

00:08:52.640 --> 00:08:55.440
She said she was taking your
responsibility and went with Roux!

00:08:55.690 --> 00:08:58.230
Mr. Torres, is Leina okay?

00:08:58.230 --> 00:09:00.490
I don't know.
The Minovsky particle density...

00:09:00.490 --> 00:09:03.030
is preventing any contact
with the La Vie en Rose!

00:09:03.030 --> 00:09:04.460
Leina!

00:09:08.510 --> 00:09:10.130
Leina!

00:09:13.330 --> 00:09:15.040
Judau, quit it!

00:09:15.040 --> 00:09:18.180
Beecha! What do you
think you're grabbing?!

00:09:26.900 --> 00:09:28.560
Oh, no! The Zaku!

00:09:30.320 --> 00:09:32.020
We're going, too!

00:09:32.020 --> 00:09:33.440
What about the Zaku?

00:09:33.440 --> 00:09:36.020
Aren't friends more important?!

00:09:36.370 --> 00:09:39.240
That Zaku is important to me, too!

00:09:42.500 --> 00:09:44.750
C-Captain! The Zaku!

00:09:51.600 --> 00:09:54.730
Torres! Engines, ahead full!

00:09:54.730 --> 00:09:57.040
There's no time to go around this!

00:09:57.040 --> 00:09:59.710
Take us straight ahead toward
the front of theLa Vie en Rose!

00:09:59.710 --> 00:10:00.630
Aye, aye!

00:10:00.630 --> 00:10:03.510
But do something
about that Zaku first!

00:10:10.660 --> 00:10:13.270
Okay... We can use this Zaku.

00:10:15.290 --> 00:10:17.980
Oh, you stubborn...!
Leave us alone, already!

00:10:17.980 --> 00:10:19.770
You can't escape!

00:10:21.170 --> 00:10:22.360
Big Brother!

00:10:22.360 --> 00:10:24.320
What is it, Leina?

00:10:28.590 --> 00:10:30.470
I've finally caught you.

00:10:30.470 --> 00:10:33.200
Huh? What's this
throbbing in my heart?

00:10:33.450 --> 00:10:36.660
Mama, could this be
what people call love?

00:10:36.660 --> 00:10:39.790
Let me go!
Let go, you mama's boy!

00:10:39.790 --> 00:10:41.220
Big Brother!

00:10:49.990 --> 00:10:53.150
Hang on, Leina!
I'm coming to save you!

00:10:56.240 --> 00:10:59.260
- Glemy Toto!
- Miss Roux, don't!

00:10:59.260 --> 00:11:02.440
You only want to capture me, right?

00:11:02.440 --> 00:11:04.530
This girl's still just a kid.

00:11:04.530 --> 00:11:08.610
If you promise to spare her,
I'll come with you.

00:11:08.610 --> 00:11:09.660
Miss Roux!

00:11:09.660 --> 00:11:11.240
Of course, I promise.

00:11:11.240 --> 00:11:14.410
Miss Roux.
Please, come to me, Miss Roux.

00:11:14.410 --> 00:11:15.620
Don't go!

00:11:15.620 --> 00:11:17.080
It's okay, Leina.

00:11:17.310 --> 00:11:21.050
Wow!
So cute and handsome!

00:11:21.430 --> 00:11:23.720
Aw, you're flattering me.

00:11:25.230 --> 00:11:27.260
- Mr. Glemy...
- Yes?

00:11:27.260 --> 00:11:28.430
SORRY!

00:11:31.700 --> 00:11:33.310
No problem!

00:11:35.770 --> 00:11:39.070
Let's see...
Man, this cockpit's ancient!

00:11:39.790 --> 00:11:41.760
This one?

00:11:41.760 --> 00:11:43.900
Didn't you kind of overdo that?

00:11:43.900 --> 00:11:46.440
What, you don't mind if I'm their prisoner?

00:11:46.440 --> 00:11:47.810
I do...

00:11:47.810 --> 00:11:51.960
Damn that woman! Poking my
weak points, one after another!

00:11:58.180 --> 00:12:01.970
There's no way in hell
I'm ever going to forgive her!

00:12:18.980 --> 00:12:21.440
- He's coming!
- Leina! Where are you?!

00:12:21.440 --> 00:12:25.700
Big Brother! We're here!
Hurry! We're being chased!

00:12:28.630 --> 00:12:30.530
Leina, I'm coming!

00:12:30.530 --> 00:12:33.410
The one on your tail's
the bad guy, right?!

00:12:34.880 --> 00:12:38.470
Now I'm getting insulted by
reinforcements from the Argama!

00:12:38.470 --> 00:12:41.830
Mistress Chara! It's a fighter
from the Argama! Do you read?

00:12:41.830 --> 00:12:45.040
It has to be one of the fighters
that dock to form the Gundam!

00:12:45.040 --> 00:12:49.420
We'll use the dock ship as a shield!
That'll tie their hands!

00:12:49.420 --> 00:12:52.630
We'll seize the dock later!
Gaza team, respond to attack!

00:12:52.630 --> 00:12:54.020
Aye!

00:13:04.400 --> 00:13:06.020
Leina! Are you okay?

00:13:06.020 --> 00:13:08.910
Big Brother! You made it!

00:13:11.800 --> 00:13:13.840
What are Beecha and Elle doing?!

00:13:13.840 --> 00:13:16.460
I can't form the
Double Zeta like this!

00:13:20.200 --> 00:13:22.540
We should really
get out of here, Elle!

00:13:22.540 --> 00:13:24.180
Now what's the problem?

00:13:24.180 --> 00:13:25.510
Look!

00:13:25.510 --> 00:13:28.140
We can't fly into that mess!

00:13:28.770 --> 00:13:32.170
Shall I let you off here, then?
I'll lend you my helmet!

00:13:32.170 --> 00:13:36.510
Elle! Is that any way to talk to
someone who's been so nice to you?

00:13:36.510 --> 00:13:38.060
Since when?!

00:13:44.120 --> 00:13:45.520
Sorry we're late, Judau!

00:13:45.520 --> 00:13:46.900
Elle?

00:13:48.210 --> 00:13:53.030
They're darting around like a damn flies!
I'll take them all with the Double Zeta!

00:13:53.030 --> 00:13:54.650
Elle! Roux! Let's go!

00:13:54.650 --> 00:13:56.160
- Roger!
- Roger!

00:13:57.920 --> 00:14:00.540
Gaza-C team! Keep those
three machines apart!

00:14:00.540 --> 00:14:03.330
If we let them dock,
we're in trouble!

00:14:05.720 --> 00:14:07.810
Is that you, Roux Louka?!

00:14:07.810 --> 00:14:09.090
You stubborn...!

00:14:09.090 --> 00:14:12.560
- He likes you, doesn't he?
- What are you talking about?!

00:14:13.400 --> 00:14:14.550
Judau!

00:14:14.550 --> 00:14:16.260
Hold out till the
Argama gets there!

00:14:16.260 --> 00:14:18.140
Zeta Gundam, ready to launch!

00:14:18.140 --> 00:14:20.140
Huh? It's fixed already?

00:14:20.140 --> 00:14:22.980
It's kinda jury-rigged,
but it should work.

00:14:25.490 --> 00:14:28.940
Right. Go to it.
Iino, be careful.

00:14:28.940 --> 00:14:29.960
Roger!

00:14:29.960 --> 00:14:31.740
Captain! Look!

00:14:32.500 --> 00:14:34.170
What in blazes...?!

00:14:34.170 --> 00:14:37.490
Zeta, on catapult deck!
Launching!

00:14:37.490 --> 00:14:39.530
How is that the Zeta?!

00:14:39.530 --> 00:14:43.590
Iino! You're just going to end
up getting hit by friendly fire!

00:14:44.220 --> 00:14:47.420
The Endra
doesn't have any Zakus!

00:14:47.420 --> 00:14:51.300
Tell Judau and the others
I'm launching in the Zeta Zaku!

00:14:53.250 --> 00:14:58.680
Judau! We're sending out a Zaku-headed
Zeta! Don't mistake it for an enemy!

00:15:01.450 --> 00:15:03.560
What's this frame?!

00:15:04.780 --> 00:15:07.940
I can't use the
360-degree screen now?

00:15:07.940 --> 00:15:11.360
I won't be able to see any
enemies outside of the frame!

00:15:11.360 --> 00:15:13.200
Can't shake 'em!

00:15:18.550 --> 00:15:19.660
Judau!

00:15:19.660 --> 00:15:22.080
Iino?
A Zeon Zaku!

00:15:25.090 --> 00:15:28.460
The body's the Zeta, right?!
This is the Zeta, Judau!

00:15:28.620 --> 00:15:32.380
That's the Zeta?!
What did you do to its head?

00:15:32.380 --> 00:15:37.180
Maybe you'd rather I didn't come!
They're after the Core Base!

00:15:39.230 --> 00:15:42.230
Dammit! Even more of them!

00:15:43.320 --> 00:15:46.430
Leina! Thank goodness!
You're okay!

00:15:46.430 --> 00:15:47.730
I'm with her!

00:15:47.730 --> 00:15:49.640
No need to worry, right?

00:15:49.640 --> 00:15:53.990
But couldn't you have done something
better with the Zeta's head?

00:15:54.580 --> 00:15:59.700
I can see now that it's a half-assed
mobile suit! I'll take it right away!

00:16:00.050 --> 00:16:01.710
Incoming!

00:16:03.840 --> 00:16:06.410
J-Judau! Form the Double Zeta!

00:16:06.410 --> 00:16:08.120
Let's do it, everyone!
You reading me?

00:16:08.120 --> 00:16:09.670
- We hear you!
- We hear you!

00:16:15.250 --> 00:16:16.750
Roux! Elle!

00:16:16.750 --> 00:16:18.590
Core Base, standby okay!

00:16:18.590 --> 00:16:19.800
Core Top, okay!

00:16:20.050 --> 00:16:22.350
Okay then!

00:16:49.050 --> 00:16:51.050
The Double Zeta!

00:16:51.760 --> 00:16:54.760
You show your back
to your enemy?!

00:16:57.900 --> 00:16:59.340
Papa, Mama...

00:16:59.340 --> 00:17:02.640
Protect me with the blessing
of our family name!

00:17:08.490 --> 00:17:11.320
It's so much more
powerful than me!

00:17:11.660 --> 00:17:14.780
J-Judau!
Are you trying to kill us?!

00:17:17.210 --> 00:17:20.380
Beecha! Elle!
Why are you still in there?

00:17:20.380 --> 00:17:22.820
That's what
we'd like to know!

00:17:22.820 --> 00:17:23.820
Get out!

00:17:23.820 --> 00:17:25.210
Oh, come on!

00:17:33.810 --> 00:17:35.270
Who's next?!

00:17:35.270 --> 00:17:36.960
I'm gonna die...

00:17:36.960 --> 00:17:38.560
I'm gonna puke...

00:17:38.560 --> 00:17:39.750
Mistress Chara!

00:17:39.750 --> 00:17:43.420
Our Gaza team is no match
for that new Gundam!

00:17:43.420 --> 00:17:44.760
Quiet!

00:17:44.760 --> 00:17:48.400
If worse comes to worst,
we'll hold the dock ship hostage!

00:17:49.320 --> 00:17:50.720
What happened?!

00:17:50.720 --> 00:17:53.060
The dock ship's begun
pushing us away!

00:17:53.060 --> 00:17:54.530
What?!

00:17:57.540 --> 00:18:00.860
Mistress Chara! At this rate,
those arms will rip us apart!

00:18:01.110 --> 00:18:04.240
Dammit...!
Retrothrust us out of the arms!

00:18:04.240 --> 00:18:06.910
I'm going out
in the R-Jarja!

00:18:10.330 --> 00:18:13.730
Mistress Chara!
Please put on a normal suit!

00:18:13.730 --> 00:18:18.510
If I wear that stuffy thing, I won't get
the sensations of the battlefield!

00:18:20.310 --> 00:18:24.260
With the Double Zeta's power,
I can take out a battleship with one shot!

00:18:24.470 --> 00:18:26.130
Double Zeta, incoming!

00:18:26.130 --> 00:18:27.760
I know!

00:18:29.610 --> 00:18:33.020
Bigger doesn't always
mean better, pal!

00:18:36.990 --> 00:18:39.020
The enemy! The enemy!

00:18:39.020 --> 00:18:42.580
Oh, my chest feels like it's about
to burst! What a feeling!

00:18:44.090 --> 00:18:46.360
What's that mobile suit?

00:18:46.360 --> 00:18:50.000
Is he leaving himself open
to tempt me? Must be good!

00:18:53.470 --> 00:18:55.290
Dance and dance some more!

00:18:55.290 --> 00:18:57.210
Not bad!

00:18:57.720 --> 00:19:01.920
You feel it too, don't you? The feeling
of your soul charging through space!

00:19:01.920 --> 00:19:04.630
Lemme go!
What are you talking about?!

00:19:04.630 --> 00:19:08.730
Space is flying toward us!
The trip is so much fun!

00:19:12.280 --> 00:19:14.690
What...did I just see?

00:19:15.830 --> 00:19:17.940
What's wrong, Judau?!

00:19:17.940 --> 00:19:20.010
Maybe he's paralyzed?

00:19:20.010 --> 00:19:23.520
Was the transformation too complicated,
and now you can't move, Judau?

00:19:23.520 --> 00:19:25.700
Big Brother, what's wrong?

00:19:27.840 --> 00:19:31.370
Big Brother, what's wrong?!
Snap out of it!

00:19:33.300 --> 00:19:35.180
I still see it...

00:19:35.180 --> 00:19:37.830
It's no use.
Did he pass out?

00:19:37.830 --> 00:19:38.840
Okay, then...

00:19:39.970 --> 00:19:42.760
Get away from me,
you little pest!

00:19:48.110 --> 00:19:49.560
Leina!

00:19:57.850 --> 00:19:59.230
What?

00:19:59.230 --> 00:20:01.860
Is that a mobile suit
or a monster?!

00:20:01.860 --> 00:20:05.240
I'll finish you with this!
Please... work!

00:20:09.880 --> 00:20:11.580
Wh-What's...?!

00:20:20.350 --> 00:20:24.710
Huh? I've lost all power!
Even the beam saber's offline!

00:20:24.710 --> 00:20:27.210
Hey! Double Zeta,
what's wrong?!

00:20:27.440 --> 00:20:29.480
Leina!

00:20:29.480 --> 00:20:30.930
Leina!

00:20:32.690 --> 00:20:34.440
Core Fighter, move!

00:20:37.820 --> 00:20:39.060
Roux Louka.

00:20:39.060 --> 00:20:43.490
Even after you've twice
betrayed me, I'll still save you.

00:20:46.000 --> 00:20:49.940
Glemy! That's not me!
C'mon, fighter!

00:20:49.940 --> 00:20:52.870
Damn you! Piece of junk!
Leina!

00:20:55.090 --> 00:20:56.830
What a disaster!

00:20:56.830 --> 00:21:02.340
Gaza team! Rescue Mistress Chara and return
to the ship at once! We're retreating!

00:21:10.730 --> 00:21:12.930
Judau! The Endra's
running for it!

00:21:12.930 --> 00:21:14.050
You bastards!

00:21:14.050 --> 00:21:16.220
Wait... Where's Leina?

00:21:16.220 --> 00:21:18.720
She was with Roux, but...
Leina is...!

00:21:18.720 --> 00:21:20.930
Huh? Something
happened to Leina?!

00:21:20.930 --> 00:21:23.030
The Core Fighter
got swatted away!

00:21:26.960 --> 00:21:29.160
The Core Fighter!

00:21:30.920 --> 00:21:33.160
Leina! Roux...

00:21:38.970 --> 00:21:41.700
Roux!
Why isn't Leina with you?!

00:21:41.700 --> 00:21:45.290
I... I'm sorry, Judau.
Leina was...

00:21:45.290 --> 00:21:46.630
What happened?!

00:21:46.630 --> 00:21:49.040
She was taken by one of
the Endra's mobile suits.

00:21:49.040 --> 00:21:50.260
What?!

00:21:50.260 --> 00:21:51.720
Judau!

00:21:55.070 --> 00:21:58.100
Damn you, Endra!
Where did you go?!

00:22:01.430 --> 00:22:03.350
Where?!
Where did you go?!

00:22:03.530 --> 00:22:06.650
Between these dummy rocks and
the Minovsky particles...

00:22:06.650 --> 00:22:10.030
we'll never find them now
that they're out of sight.

00:22:17.090 --> 00:22:19.370
So, this wasn't Miss Roux Louka.

00:22:19.370 --> 00:22:21.910
Now what do I do?
She's a little kid.

00:22:21.910 --> 00:22:25.840
- Big Brother...
- How could I have been so careless?

00:22:30.310 --> 00:22:33.180
Where did you go, Leina?

00:22:45.850 --> 00:22:51.520
<i>michi mo nai areta genya ni
Amidst the wasteland without any roads...</i>

00:22:53.030 --> 00:22:58.740
<i>reeru wo tsukuru no wa kurushii koto sa
...it's difficult to lay down your rails.</i>

00:23:00.950 --> 00:23:03.240
<i>dakedo
However...</i>

00:23:03.240 --> 00:23:09.540
<i>tooi mukou mo shiranakucha ikenai
You've gotta know what's on the other side...</i>

00:23:09.540 --> 00:23:16.630
<i>boku-tachi wa kore kara nanda
...it's all from here on for us.</i>

00:23:16.630 --> 00:23:21.050
<i>"yume wo wasureta kodomo-tachi" to
"Children will forget their dreams"...</i>

00:23:21.050 --> 00:23:23.430
<i>hito wa iu
...is what they say.</i>

00:23:26.350 --> 00:23:33.650
<i>aa jidai ga naiteiru
Ah, the times are crying.</i>

00:23:45.280 --> 00:23:47.690
Mondo and Beecha seem
to be up to something,

00:23:47.690 --> 00:23:50.270
but all I care about
is getting Leina back!

00:23:50.270 --> 00:23:53.480
Captain Bright! I know you
locked me up just to be safe,

00:23:53.480 --> 00:23:55.440
but you've got this all wrong!

00:23:55.440 --> 00:23:58.820
That's why the enemy ends up
getting the jump on us.

00:23:59.010 --> 00:24:02.950
When the Core Top gets separated,
you'll just have to see what I do!

00:24:02.950 --> 00:24:04.620
Why, you...

00:24:04.620 --> 00:24:08.250
Next time, on Gundam ZZ:
"Little Sister!"

00:24:08.250 --> 00:24:10.840
I won't let anyone see my tears.

00:24:09.670 --> 00:24:12.800
LITTLE SISTER!

00:24:09.670 --> 00:24:12.800
Next Time
